__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.DS_Store

# Model weights never belong in the repo. They are resolved through ComfyUI's
# folder_paths at runtime -- see the model table in README.md.
*.safetensors
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.bin

# NOTE: DiffHDR/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The upstream tree is vendored and
# committed rather than cloned on first run. A runtime clone does not survive a deploy
# that mirrors directories (`rsync --delete` and friends): it gets wiped while leaving
# enough behind that a naive "is it present?" check still passes, and the loader then
# fails with a confusing ImportError. Vendoring makes an install self-contained.
# See DiffHDR/VENDORED.md.
